      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we allow an existing single-family entry to acquire the other family before asserting equality? After `set cnat snat-policy addr 30.0.0.1`, `set cnat snat-policy addr 30.0.0.1 2001:db8::1` (or switching to an interface) now yields non-null `cpe4` and null `cpe6`, so the assertion immediately below aborts a debug VPP. Previously the missing-family lookup returned the default entry and these updates succeeded. Add regression coverage for upgrading a single-family default policy to dual stack/interface configuration.",
      "tag": "prview:78d51056336e066720f0d4ed975f70c0:905a740f575972b2aec9f59604be5c36bf242acc",
      "revId": "905a740f575972b2aec9f59604be5c36bf242acc",
